title: "AMBER2LAMMPS: A validated, provenance-aware, and agent-ready framework for AMBER-family simulations in LAMMPS"
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18114886
date-released: 2026-11-15
url: "https://github.com/askforarun/AMBER2LAMMPS"
abstract: "A validation-first framework for translating fully parameterized AMBER-family systems to LAMMPS. It combines energy-and-force validation against AMBER sander, machine-readable provenance, fail-closed scientific checks, and a bounded MCP interface that returns compact decision-relevant summaries while retaining large molecular artifacts on disk."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/askforarun/AMBER2LAMMPS"
